<title>ITALY: Fiat Auto to hire 2,000 workers.</title>
<headline>Fiat Auto to hire 2,000 workers.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian car maker Fiat Auto on Tuesday confirmed that it is to hire an extra 2,000 workers in its Italian car plants due to rising car orders reflecting a national car buying incentive scheme.</p>
</text>
